{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人江若琳（Elanne）與丈夫蕭唯展（前名蕭潤邦）婚後感情穩定，育有一名兒子Owen，家庭生活美滿，不過她繼續努力追求音樂夢，趁心中仍有一團火的時候作出這個選擇，正如堅強也是一種選擇，成功與否，事在人為。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T09:23:59.568870+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T09:01:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T09:17:18.361298+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T09:17:18.361298+00:00","content_hash":"223fd3d7b795287f7fa1bcfc23639926849959099bc804c03ecab5fa5501c9fe","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}